{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/4d56b16cd9fb463e942e7345b7081f6c/snapshots/4ea1b5eabf4d4c0ba488ae3b25d01d0c-00001.jpg\"/><p>一群西伯利亞羱羊屬中國國家重點保護的稀有物種，近日被發現在中國西北部新疆維吾爾自治區的雪山間奔跑與覓食。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8507537_新疆雪山現瀕危西伯利亞羱羊 奔跑覓食添生機 - 截图7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/4d56b16cd9fb463e942e7345b7081f6c/snapshots/4ea1b5eabf4d4c0ba488ae3b25d01d0c-00007.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>在近期一場降雪期間，這些動物穿梭於崎嶇的地形中，為寧靜的冬日景致增添了生機。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8507537_新疆雪山現瀕危西伯利亞羱羊 奔跑覓食添生機 - 截图5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/4d56b16cd9fb463e942e7345b7081f6c/snapshots/4ea1b5eabf4d4c0ba488ae3b25d01d0c-00005.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>西伯利亞羱羊通常棲息於海拔3,500至6,000公尺的陡峭山坡，活躍於中亞與北亞的高山環境，並在冬季臨近時遷移至較低海拔地區。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.442355+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T23:17:32.315808+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:37:17.159461+00:00","content_hash":"4626d6ce23244623a5ac78f83d90b8a178eab41025271e7b644873058f509fe4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.442355+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}